Nagaiyar Krishnamurthy and Chiranjib Kumar Gupta. Extractive Metallurgy of Rare Earths, second edition, CRC Press, copyright 2016, 869 pages. [Official publisher and complete scope](https://www.routledge.com/Extractive-Metallurgy-of-Rare-Earths/Krishnamurthy-Gupta/p/book/9781466576346).

An optional commercial advanced monograph, accessed through a library or purchase. Read the entire book for a sustained rare-earth specialization and complete chapters for separation, reduction, refining, material preparation, recycling, analysis, and environmental/process evidence. Use original references to test the actual method and feed system rather than transferring a generic separation ratio across all rare earths.

